+        // then moveToStack will create a [2 x jlvaluet] bitcast to { float, jlvaluet }. 
+        // This later causes the GC rooting pass, to miss-characterize the float as a pointer to a GC value", "landed_diff": "--- a/src/llvm-alloc-opt.cpp
